# External benchmark sources (feature 026). Installed and downloaded, never vendored.
# AppWorld's task, interface and answer-key content is licensed for public
# redistribution only in its packed form, and this repository is public: its root
# lives outside the repo, and these lines are the second guard.
# See monarch-benchmark/workflowbench/wb_worlds/*/LEGAL.md.
appworld-root/
monarch-benchmark/workflowbench/appworld-root/
monarch-benchmark/workflowbench/.external/
monarch-benchmark/workflowbench/corpus-appworld/
# EnterpriseOps-Gym (Apache-2.0) and tau2-bench (MIT) place no such condition, so
# their imported corpora and frozen task sets are committed like the AutomationBench
# ones -- a task set that is not in the repository cannot be frozen by hash.

